.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-s3-object-legal-hold-set - Place or remove a legal hold


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro s3 object legal-hold set   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Place or remove a legal hold

.PP
\fBstatus\fR on / off (locked buckets only). A legal hold blocks deletion with no end date, independent of retention; you can remove it yourself.

.PP
API: PUT /cloud/storage/{id}/buckets/{bucket}/objects/legal-hold (operationId setStorageObjectLegalHold, scope services_write)


